# Origin of the deployed API. Leave unset for local development: Vite proxies
# /api to the backend, so the browser sees a single origin and CORS never
# applies. Set it for any deployed build, where the two halves are on
# different origins.
#
# Origin only — no trailing slash and no /api suffix, both of which the client
# adds itself.
VITE_API_ROOT=https://salary-management-api-u7yt.onrender.com
